    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_CeladonCity_Condominiums_RoofRoom_Text_TheresNothingIDontKnow",
      "en_US": [
        "There is nothing that I don’t know,\n",
        "like I wrote on the blackboard.\r",
        "I know about the world of Pokémon\n",
        "in your Game Boy Advance!\r",
        "Get together with your friends and\n",
        "enjoy trading Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_CeladonCity_Condominiums_RoofRoom_Text_WirelessAdapterLecture",
