    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_CeladonCity_Condominiums_RoofRoom_Text_PamphletOnTMs",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a pamphlet on TMs.\r",
        "… …\r",
        "There are fifty TMs in all.\r",
        "There are also seven HMs that\n",
        "can be used repeatedly.\r",
        "Silph Co."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_CeladonCity_Condominiums_RoofRoom_Text_ObtainedAnEevee",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} obtained an Eevee!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_gText_NicknameThisPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_gText_NoMoreRoomForPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no more room for Pokémon!\r",
        "The Pokémon Boxes are full and\n",
        "can’t accept any more!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_CeladonCity_Condominiums_RoofRoom_Text_ExplainWirelessClub",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon Wireless Club is\n",
        "upstairs at any Pokémon Center.\r",
        "Visit one to link up with friend(s)\n",
        "using your Wireless Adapter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_CeladonCity_Condominiums_RoofRoom_Text_ExplainDirectCorner",
      "en_US": [
        "To link only with a friend, go to\n",
        "the Direct Corner.\r",
        "It is the right counter at the\n",
        "Pokémon Wireless Club.\r",
        "Go into the Trade Corner or the\n",
        "Colosseum with your friend."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0505_T07R0205_CeladonCity_Condominiums_RoofRoom_Text_ExplainUnionRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "To link and communicate with\n",
        "anyone, go to the Union Room.\r",
        "It is the left counter at the\n",
        "Pokémon Wireless Club.\r",
        "Go to the Union Room and enjoy\n",
        "meeting other Trainers."
      ]
    },
    {
